OL,3,GNEWSAPolice close city centre areas
OL,4,Aover crime concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn area of Peterborough city centre has
OL,7,Fbeen closed to the public by police
OL,8,Ffollowing reports of anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour.
OL,11,FThe closure affects part of Rivergate
OL,12,Fafter an Open Space Closure Order was
OL,13,Fgranted at Peterborough Magistrates'
OL,14,FCourt on Monday, following an
OL,15,Fapplication by Cambridgeshire Police.
OL,17,FThe order covers the parking areas
OL,18,Fbeneath Burlington House, Churchill
OL,19,FHouse, Admiral House and Riverview in
OL,20,FViersen Platz.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
