OL,3,GNEWSAPolice close city centre areas
OL,4,Aover crime concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will remain in force for three
OL,7,Fmonths and prohibits access to everyone
OL,8,Fexcept residents of the flats covered
OL,9,Fby the order, employees of the
OL,10,Fmanagement company and emergency
OL,11,Fservice workers.
